		RVC multilingual base-model pretraining


This bundle prepares one RVC v2, 40 kHz, F0-guided multi-speaker base model from:

AISHELL/AISHELL-3 on Hugging Face;
badayvedat/VCTK on Hugging Face;
the official JVS Google Drive archive;
hfm_whisper_110spk.zip in Rvcmodel/gbs.

The HFM package contains 13,303 mono 48 kHz/16-bit WAV files from 110 speakers, totaling 19.889 hours. Its SHA-256 is cfc382e9b9b176a3c9d854bbcd0edaf8647d3beaba13ca6ea5f84abdb899a3db.
